    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "18 lollies",
      "worked": "Total number of lollies:\n\n$$28\\times9=252$$\n\nNumber of lollies in each new bag:\n\n$$252\\div14=18$$\n\nEach person now receives 18 lollies.",
